e:["$","p","Choose plugs with a physical button and local schedules when possible. Cloud outages should not make an ordinary lamp unusable.",{"children":"Choose plugs with a physical button and local schedules when possible. Cloud outages should not make an ordinary lamp unusable."}]
f:["$","p","Name devices by room and purpose—“Office lamp,” not “Plug 3”—so voice commands and troubleshooting stay sane.",{"children":"Name devices by room and purpose—“Office lamp,” not “Plug 3”—so voice commands and troubleshooting stay sane."}]
